        "original_id": "d33b5e8f-ff5f-5ea4-b392-3d0e8f7738d2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nick Carter, Brady Seals, Avril Lavigne, Jordan Knight\n- Music projects: Backstreet Boys, Nick & Knight\n- Products: Now or Never, I'm Taking Off, All American, Play Time, Get Over Me\n- Topics: solo albums, country music\n\nFacts:\n- Brady Seals was born on March 29, 1969, and is an American country music artist.\n- Nick Carter was born on January 28, 1980, and is an American singer, songwriter, actor, and dancer.\n- Brady Seals released his fourth solo album, \"Play Time,\" in 2009 via Star City.\n- By 2015, Nick Carter had released three solo albums, \"Now or Never,\" \"I'm Taking Off,\" and \"All American,\" during breaks in Backstreet Boys schedules.\n- By 2015, Nick Carter had also released a collaboration with Jordan Knight titled \"Nick & Knight.\"\n- \"Get Over Me\" is a song by American singer and songwriter Nick Carter featuring Canadian singer Avril Lavigne.",
